  "question": {
    "text": "If a variable plane, at a distance of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn></math>&nbsp;units from the origin, intersects the coordinate axes at&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>C</mi></math>, then the locus of the centroid of <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#916;</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></math> is"
  },
